        "TileImage": "$($repository 22a19308-5b21-4e80-a915-467ebc43a1de).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour targets are five individuals whose routines have made them predictable. Their reliance on a particular habit has introduced a level of carelessness the client finds unacceptable. The outcome of this operation must appear entirely accidental, with no indication of deliberate involvement.\r\rEliminate all designated targets and ensure their habit proves fatal.\r\rCreator - HorizontalDuck",
